        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/34f0e0/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-03T10:19:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nah, if it were me pretending to be a clone pretending to be me I’d go full blown self parody with it, I’d be asking weird shipping questions, I’d use “like” in place of commas, and I’d go on rambling tangents not related to what I asked in the first place. The clone’s just asking regular questions while playing a character like that person who RP’s the cult of Gloom.</p>",
