      {
        "id": 200937,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-03T12:53:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Don't forget the Legend of Zelda \"item get\" jingle that plays when he grabs it!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh man yes you're right, this makes it even better, since I actually did initially imagine Anthony holding the Bell over his head Link-style. Once again I wish I had drawing skills…&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Princess Cool\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Princess Cool:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Nah, if it were me pretending to be a clone pretending to be me I'd go full blown self parody with it, I'd be asking weird shipping questions,</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Considering the RPG timeline, ironically I don't think you could come up with a shipping question for Anthony that was all that much weirder than actual canon.</p>",
