      {
        "id": 200942,
        "name": "speedyolrac",
        "username": "speedyolrac",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-09T11:39:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am glad you made that typo PrincessCool. If you did write the whole biomancer thing it means we got some insight on Biomancer. He makes clones and gathers info. Well that is my take away.<br>\nI don’t venture into the Shipping forum much but are you an active poster there PrinessCool?<br>\nShould have asked about the void, submitted those as La Comodora questions. Oh well, Foote what was the post you made long ago about the Void? Did they answer it all. Going to start digging. I have a load of questions for La Capitan and I need to start submitting it.</p>",
        "post_number": 28,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:29:20.611Z",
